## Current State (What Exists)

### Working Features
| Feature | Files | Status |
|---------|-------|--------|
| Craving Logging | CravingLogForm, CravingLogViewModel | Works |
| Usage Logging | UsageLogForm, UsageLogViewModel | Works |
